---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
---
<Base>

<Hero image="/images/admin.jpg" crumbs={[{ label: "Services" }]} kicker="Services & third-party administration" title="The strategy matters. So does every detail after it." lede="Sterling Pension Group brings plan design, administration, and professional coordination into one clearer experience for business owners and their advisors.">
  <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Talk through your current plan</a></div>
</Hero>

<section class="wrap section">
  <div class="grid4">
    <article class="panel"><span class="icon-circle gold"><Icon name="target" size={26} /></span><h3>Plan design support</h3><p>Translate your retirement objective into an understandable plan design conversation, with contribution targets and business realities in view.</p></article>
    <article class="panel"><span class="icon-circle gold"><Icon name="doc" size={26} /></span><h3>Documentation coordination</h3><p>Keep the plan documents, onboarding steps, and professional handoffs moving in the right order.</p></article>
    <article class="panel"><span class="icon-circle gold"><Icon name="people" size={26} /></span><h3>Annual administration</h3><p>Coordinate census information, participant records, annual testing, reporting, and the details that keep a plan current.</p></article>
    <article class="panel"><span class="icon-circle gold"><Icon name="shield" size={26} /></span><h3>Compliance workflow</h3><p>Stay organized around deadlines, notices, required filings, and the professional certifications that belong in the process.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="navy-split">
  <div class="photo-side"><img src="/images/admin.jpg" alt="Illustration representing pension compliance and TPA governance" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" /></div>
  <div class="copy">
    <p class="kicker">What we take off your plate</p>
    <h2>A more connected way to manage a complex plan.</h2>
    <p>The strongest plan strategy can lose momentum when the annual work is fragmented. Our role is to make the handoffs clear, the documentation organized, and the path forward easier to see.</p>
    <p>Design without a census is a sketch. Administration without a calendar is a scramble in July. Sterling sits between the owner, the CPA, and the independent Enrolled Actuary so those three are not discovering the same fact in three different months. The recurring work is described on <a href="/administration">administration</a>. The annual review list is on <a href="/compliance">compliance</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section"><div class="split">
  <div>
    <p class="kicker">How we partner</p>
    <h2>Built to keep owners, advisors, and administrators aligned.</h2>
    <ul class="checklist on-light">
      <li><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} />A dedicated point of contact who knows the history of your plan</li>
      <li><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} />Clear, plain-English communication at each meaningful milestone</li>
      <li><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} />Thoughtful coordination with CPAs, attorneys, investment professionals, and independent Enrolled Actuaries</li>
      <li><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} />A long-term view of the plan—not just a transaction at the end of the year</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <aside class="callout"><Icon name="info" size={26} /><p>We are not the actuary, the CPA, the attorney, or the investment adviser. When the filing needs a certified valuation, that signature belongs to an independent Enrolled Actuary. When the return needs a deduction, that signature belongs to your CPA. Sterling’s job is the plan’s administration and the coordination around it. The fee split is on <a href="/fees">fees and who does what</a>.</p></aside>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="wrap cta-section tight-top"><div class="cta">
  <div><p class="kicker">Need a steadier process?</p><h2>Bring us the complicated version.</h2><p>We’ll help you sort through what’s in place, what’s missing, and which next step matters most.</p></div>
  <a class="btn gold" href="/contact">Set up a consultation</a>
</div></section>

</Base>
